  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fOh3/13",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2e3a56a06d46052e14efb27b8a9c9ea3eecc5cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2e3a56a06d46052e14efb27b8a9c9ea3eecc5cb\" data-origin-width=\"991\" data-origin-height=\"879\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Da8XVt7xaqq/?stkn=MWx1dXU4YW11eGRicA==\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.instagram.com/reel/Da8XVt7xaqq/?stkn=MWx1dXU4YW11eGRicA==</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">저녁먹으면서 재밌는 릴스를 자만추 했습니다<br>도구도 간단하고... 당장 가능하겠는데?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec538c465c4d429a47fec658ea0adac3370d0470_re_1790081716756\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec538c465c4d429a47fec658ea0adac3370d0470_re_1790081716756\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그래서 바로 다이소에 갔습니다.<br>같이 간 기획샘: 또 무슨 사고 치시려고요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7c6ce885a41add3295a61dade0d47261bcf7700_re_1790081716757\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7c6ce885a41add3295a61dade0d47261bcf7700_re_1790081716757\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><p>이제 다이소는 뭐 하나의 작은 실험실이라고 생각...</p><p>실험에 있던 것들 보고 대충 연필 연필깎이 컵 사고...</p><p>하필 교무실 박스 쓰레기들을 오늘 버려서 덮을 거 하나 사고</p><p>편하게 뚫기 위해 송곳</p><p>과학실이 너무 멀어 귀찮아서(...) 건전지까지</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b6effa5aa9194c0c17df752816d62f31a34de7c7_re_1790081716756\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b6effa5aa9194c0c17df752816d62f31a34de7c7_re_1790081716756\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p>돼지인지 알고 산 젖소 연필깎이로 연필을 깎아주고</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f868c64fb955ab673460cb48cca91cd78e4b07ec_re_1790081716757\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f868c64fb955ab673460cb48cca91cd78e4b07ec_re_1790081716757\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54fe875d2e57b28eb6e54508c08cffe74e1b49fb_re_1790081716757\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54fe875d2e57b28eb6e54508c08cffe74e1b49fb_re_1790081716757\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>구멍은 그래도 전지랑 좀 맞춰야 할 거 같아서</p><p>방금 깎은 연필로 표시하고 뚫어줍니다</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5e8ef2124580c0ad8ff8d752c99baaa8078f63a_re_1790081716757\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5e8ef2124580c0ad8ff8d752c99baaa8078f63a_re_1790081716757\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/687720a20d466924c65ec5e579a62b2841e15d14_re_1790081716758\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/687720a20d466924c65ec5e579a62b2841e15d14_re_1790081716758\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>준비 완료</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c05bd62c09797225e8a337cf8cbea242c526c829_re_1790081716758\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c05bd62c09797225e8a337cf8cbea242c526c829_re_1790081716758\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92f3fdd4e31e37cd7154099109ea8cf01c7f3df5_re_1790081716758\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92f3fdd4e31e37cd7154099109ea8cf01c7f3df5_re_1790081716758\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>왼쪽이 (-) 수소 기체 오른쪽이 (+) 산소 기체 입니다</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> <span>2H<span><span style=\"color: #1a3a5c; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">₂</span></span>O(l)</span><span>→</span><span>2H<span><span style=\"color: #1a3a5c; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">₂</span></span>(g) + O<span><span style=\"color: #1a3a5c; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">₂</span></span>(g)</span> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span>수소쪽이 많이 나와야 하는 상황</span></span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvcsgt7x3dsyjl67dr5yvmdev?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1080\" data-video-height=\"1920\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvcsgt7x3dsyjl67dr5yvmdev/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33346988117&amp;kamp_tidx=0&amp;signature=yBUc6Yz28cTfF0DDuPJ0Bdk1T%2B0%3D&amp;ts=1790079317\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1080\" data-video-origin-height=\"1920\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvcsgt7x3dsyjl67dr5yvmdev?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2Y3NndDd4M2RzeWpsNjdkcjV5dm1kZXYiLCJ0aWQiOiJjMGM5NzZiOC00OTA3LTQ5NmYtYTcyMS1jODFjZTdlMTNkNGIiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3NjQ1MTN9.ng_ltVttVmLlccIMoa936NV4rMxyvVEUw4FCHCpJnOwxbGRbFRJncoWSYoUaxgbJ6Xx9EA9AQop5kQxNQL0x9A&amp;autoplay=0&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2Y3NndDd4M2RzeWpsNjdkcjV5dm1kZXYiLCJ0aWQiOiJjMGM5NzZiOC00OTA3LTQ5NmYtYTcyMS1jODFjZTdlMTNkNGIiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3NjQ1MTN9.ng_ltVttVmLlccIMoa936NV4rMxyvVEUw4FCHCpJnOwxbGRbFRJncoWSYoUaxgbJ6Xx9EA9AQop5kQxNQL0x9A&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>기포의 차이가 보이시나요?</p><p>저는 릴스에서 본 것보다 별로라 흠... 전해질이 부족한가 했습니다</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그래서 찾은 전해질.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50f2fcdd5bec2b123c827bf12f8d1c8cae2c15ed_re_1790081716759\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50f2fcdd5bec2b123c827bf12f8d1c8cae2c15ed_re_1790081716759\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p>먹다 남은 포카리스웨트 분말.</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f6630ba5aaddee90955675d8ef0e4e4a2965d6f_re_1790081716759\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f6630ba5aaddee90955675d8ef0e4e4a2965d6f_re_1790081716759\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b50fd9269884d903f49d591d628be502152a745_re_1790081716759\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b50fd9269884d903f49d591d628be502152a745_re_1790081716759\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvawv7zxdbcjqqqo66ce47yoz?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1080\" data-video-height=\"1920\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvawv7zxdbcjqqqo66ce47yoz/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33346989027&amp;kamp_tidx=0&amp;signature=%2FcoiYiuqOHnBigPrF4JezAiZMdc%3D&amp;ts=1790080227\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1080\" data-video-origin-height=\"1920\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvawv7zxdbcjqqqo66ce47yoz?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2YXd2N3p4ZGJjanFxcW82NmNlNDd5b3oiLCJ0aWQiOiIzM2M3NjJhMi05OWIyLTQ5OGUtYTRkYS0zZjJjNWJhMzk4MTQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3NjQ1MTN9.3_4rEeMM96HBj37W8xZwciGhK33KECV7sMtCpBOWWOmRzvpdr7sT8lHvfFyaakio9jDVW0Jddd9ikLY6qlzyAQ&amp;autoplay=0&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2YXd2N3p4ZGJjanFxcW82NmNlNDd5b3oiLCJ0aWQiOiIzM2M3NjJhMi05OWIyLTQ5OGUtYTRkYS0zZjJjNWJhMzk4MTQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3NjQ1MTN9.3_4rEeMM96HBj37W8xZwciGhK33KECV7sMtCpBOWWOmRzvpdr7sT8lHvfFyaakio9jDVW0Jddd9ikLY6qlzyAQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>조금 더 잘 일어난 기분?</p><p>그런데 클로드에게 물어보니...</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da5d29a8fdcc1063a5a97c2fc87d071fa7a6f9e0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da5d29a8fdcc1063a5a97c2fc87d071fa7a6f9e0\" data-origin-width=\"785\" data-origin-height=\"326\"></div><p>크흠... 크흐흠.... 머쓱</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이번엔 면적을 넓혀보면 더 잘 보일까입니다</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28751199e748734dcc936983993ee7b1c44c86fb_re_1790081716760\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28751199e748734dcc936983993ee7b1c44c86fb_re_1790081716760\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/667d950d87671edb368144086989bfb06981b3f1_re_1790081716760\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/667d950d87671edb368144086989bfb06981b3f1_re_1790081716760\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvljzccnriladxayfogi1qu0v?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1080\" data-video-height=\"1920\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvljzccnriladxayfogi1qu0v/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33346988250&amp;kamp_tidx=0&amp;signature=P6hVtRpJEQGNVuwRI%2FtC521UHp8%3D&amp;ts=1790079450\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1080\" data-video-origin-height=\"1920\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvljzccnriladxayfogi1qu0v?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2bGp6Y2NucmlsYWR4YXlmb2dpMXF1MHYiLCJ0aWQiOiIzMDIwNWZjOC0yOWUwLTQwNDMtYTk1Zi02ODM3NTk1ZTJlNjgiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3NjQ1MTN9.NnY7DLZv_VPEt5a28XWsmic8R6g0o-7sxoNpZfY4L1j5_sz5oO056xRaYo07f3dMiPSZHaE-iddbxYq-_2NEhw&amp;autoplay=0&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2bGp6Y2NucmlsYWR4YXlmb2dpMXF1MHYiLCJ0aWQiOiIzMDIwNWZjOC0yOWUwLTQwNDMtYTk1Zi02ODM3NTk1ZTJlNjgiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTE3NjQ1MTN9.NnY7DLZv_VPEt5a28XWsmic8R6g0o-7sxoNpZfY4L1j5_sz5oO056xRaYo07f3dMiPSZHaE-iddbxYq-_2NEhw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>그런데 이건 또 이거 나름대로 면적이 정확히 같은 게 아니니...</p><p>&#160;</p><p>릴스 영상은 배속을 한 거 겠죠??&#160;</p><p>진짜 일상에서 사용하는 재료들로 전기분해를 간단하게 할 수 있어서 재밌어 보였는데</p><p>전기분해 실험은 이미 빨대 실링이나 스포이트를 잘라서도 쉽게 할 수 있기도 하고</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그래도 준비 측면에선 가성비가 좋아 흥미 유발로 시키고 시뮬레이션으로 개념 정확히 잡는 것도 좋을 거 같기도 합니다</p><p>1학기 때는 키트로 실험을 시켰는데 내년엔 고민해봐야겠습니다</p><p>&#160;</p><p>인스타 과학 릴스 재밌는 게 많은 거 같아요</p><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaxjbghpUOl/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp;stkn=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.instagram.com/reel/DaxjbghpUOl/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&amp;stkn=MzRlODBiNWFlZA==</a>&#160;</p><p>안될거알지만 언젠가 해보고 싶은 거 1순위</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}